{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"CheckboxCustomFields\">Checkbox Custom Fields</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Business CheckboxCustomFields Create Custom CustomField CustomFields To ToDate Yes\">Checkbox custom fields create simple yes/no switches for tracking binary attributes across your business data.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Custom Customer Required Tax To ToDate\">Use them for flags such as <em>Tax Exempt</em>, <em>Requires Approval</em>, <em>Priority Customer</em>, or <em>Special Handling Required</em>.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Is On Yes\">Checkboxes make data entry quick and ensure consistent recording of yes/no information throughout the system.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Name\">Name</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Name\">Name</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Name On Statement\">The name identifies each checkbox field and should be phrased as a clear statement or question.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom Customer Is Tax To ToDate\">Examples: <em>Tax Exempt</em>, <em>Requires Manager Approval</em>, <em>Is Fragile</em>, <em>Preferred Customer</em>.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Placement\">Placement</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Placement\">Placement</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Is\">Shows which forms display this checkbox field.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Business Is On Rent To ToDate\">The same checkbox can appear on multiple forms, allowing you to track consistent attributes across different areas of your business.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "checkbox-custom-fields"
}
